msgstr ""
"(Preverite :ref:'KritaFAQ' za iskanje konfiguracijske datoteke Kritarc v "
"vašem sistemu.)"

#: ../../tutorials/eye_tracker.rst:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you're using a hovering mouse control menu like we do, you also have to "
"figure out where to place it when it's collapsed. Put it somewhere where it "
"will be easily accessible but where it will not interfere with Krita. On the "
"screenshot you can see it at the left edge of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Če uporabljate lebdeči meni za nadzor miške, kot smo mi, morate ugotoviti "
"tudi, kam ga lahko postavite, ko se zruši. Postavite jo nekam, kjer bo lahko "
"dostopna, vendar ne bo posegla v Krito. Na posnetku zaslona ga lahko vidite "
"na levem robu zaslona."

